            "review_title": "Review at Mon Ngon Sai Thanh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "wendymagz\nMatamata, New Zealand1464 contributions\n0\nDelicious Meals\nMar 2019 • Couples\nOur first night in Hanoi and we had no idea where to go for dinner, so we asked at our hotel reception what they would recommend. The ladies suggested the Mon Ngon Sai Thanh, at Da Tuong, just along the road from our hotel. We enjoyed a very tasty meal of pork and shrimps with a caramelised sauce and beef and bell peppers. Most of the staff spoke a little English, and were very happy to oblige when we had trouble understanding the menu. Our meal was delicious and we would certainly return to try more of the great food served here. Highly recommend this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 11, 2019",
