            "review_text": "Moconacire\nManila, Philippines162 contributions\n0\nsurprisingly good!!\nSep 2017\nthis place was recommended to us by the hotel. we went there during lunch and werent impressed with the place. it gave a vibe that it wasn't an authentic Vietnamese restaurant. \n\nBut we were hungry so we ordered a lot and we were surprised the food was really good! it felt home cooked and we loved the pancake which we havent tried elsewhere!!\nit was our last day and we even thought of having another meal there!! i didnt see much tourists there and there arent much reviews on trip advisor but i recommend people to try it if theyre in the area! we loved the food!! the place was clean too! even the coffee we ordered was good! would definitely go back!\nRead more\nWritten September 9, 2017",
